                        <span class="text-outline">Infrastructure</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 font-light mb-10 border-l-2 border-brand-orange pl-6">
                        We help housing societies bring vital government benefits directly to residents, transforming committees into proactive enablers without adding administrative overhead.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="space-y-6 mb-12">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                            <div class="mt-1 flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-orange/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-brand-orange">
