            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-y-12 md:gap-x-8 lg:gap-x-12 relative before:absolute before:top-0 before:bottom-0 before:left-1/3 before:hidden md:before:block before:w-[1px] before:bg-white/10 after:absolute after:top-0 after:bottom-0 after:right-1/3 after:hidden md:after:block after:w-[1px] after:bg-white/10">
                <div class="reveal relative z-10 bg-brand-dark md:px-6">
                    <span class="block text-brand-orange font-oswald text-5xl mb-4 opacity-50">01</span>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">End-to-End Management</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">From initial awareness circulars to final document delivery, we handle the entire lifecycle within your premises.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="reveal delay-100 relative z-10 bg-brand-dark md:px-6">
                    <span class="block text-brand-orange font-oswald text-5xl mb-4 opacity-50">02</span>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Clear Guidance</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">No ambiguous instructions. We provide exact checklists tailored for middle-class demographic requirements.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="reveal delay-200 relative z-10 bg-brand-dark md:px-6">
                    <span class="block text-brand-orange font-oswald text-5xl mb-4 opacity-50">03</span>
                    <h3 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Trusted & Scalable</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Operating with institutional discipline. We treat society data and resident privacy with absolute strictest protocols.</p>
